---

## Models Used

| Model | Size | Purpose | Cost |
|---|---|---|---|
| `nomic-embed-text` | 274MB | Embeddings only — converts text to 768-dim vectors | Free / Local |
| `qwen3.5:4b` | 3.4GB | Main RAG chain, routing, answer generation | Free / Local |
| `qwen2.5:1.5b` | ~1GB | Fast iteration during testing, LLM-as-judge evaluator | Free / Local |
| `qwen2.5-coder:14b` | 9.0GB | Code generation only — too slow for RAG testing | Free / Local |
| `claude-haiku-4-5-20251001` | API | Text-to-Cypher generation — small models hallucinate Cypher | ~$0.001/query |

